{"synopsis":"Jun-ho mewarisi truk makanan milik mendiang pamannya, Deok-chun. Ia pun berkeliling negeri, memasak demi membuat nama “Go Deok-chun” dikenal secara nasional. Perjalanannya dimulai dengan Se-hee, pewaris keluarga konglomerat, dan berlanjut dengan pertemuan Jun-ho bersama para wanita di setiap daerah yang ia singgahi, masing-masing dengan kisahnya sendiri! Mereka semua jatuh hati padanya, namun satu hal yang benar-benar merebut hati Jun-ho… adalah memasak!\n\nIkuti perjalanan romantis Jun-ho yang tak tertahankan bersama truk makanannya keliling negeri—bisnis, dimulai!","alternative_title":"고덕춘의 푸드트럭","author":"Popo (III)","artist":"Popo (III)","chapters":[{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"5eb56824-fa61-4124-9301-9c4c3609bd13","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"6867e724-5041-4909-bb85-2608547b0a62","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"67b77bb4-ca8b-44aa-bdad-a82eafa5a204","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"c43b62f5-c93e-40e2-8352-60c9a590d06b","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"6c607e69-1f2c-4a13-a97d-11a3eb256bd8","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"396fae31-863d-46ef-ade0-3b1ddce77361","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"1056a3d6-684f-4364-9acc-641445634f0e","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"db2d9238-5280-43ad-a8b5-93865ea303e4","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"9eda9d3e-b189-4bae-abc0-bc340e748d02","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"d424b941-cbc6-4a87-8771-21a03da46ec6","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"87aeed4b-19f2-4241-94f9-63265f574ade","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"32","chapter":"3